From 6eafdc0948225402cd788ac667121011f9fab262 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jaejinaa <wowls7990@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 21:19:34 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(openrouter): send tool images to models that read
 them

The model list already names each model's input modalities. Keep image and
file in ModelInfo.inputImages and inputFiles, and send a tool result's
pictures (as image_url parts) and PDFs (as file parts) in a following user
message only while the model advertises that kind. A model that advertises
neither keeps the existing text-only note and imagesLeftOut; one that
advertises only one kind gets that kind and the note for the other.
